From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 21:17:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07579/11362] [conductor] Checkpoint: preserve uncommitted work
 from interrupted run

Co-Authored-By: Codex CLI <noreply@openai.com>
